+- def-qftx-localized-equivariant-borel-moore-data: defines T=(C*)^r, maximal compact K, product right Milnor conventions, R_T=Q[u_i], character multiplicative set, normalized BM grading, proper/open operations, cap action and smooth fundamental classes. Direct dependencies: the imported equivariant-BM definition, six-functor theorem, batch-8 rational torus classifying-space lemma, and AC. Level 1. Local verification states the stable 2rm approximation shift, coefficient convention and K subset T Borel comparison.
