+---
+id: ex-qftx-localized-bm-proper-fixed-component
+kind: example
+title: A noncompact variety with a proper fixed component
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 6
