+kind: definition
+title: Intrinsic localized pushforward for a proper fixed locus
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 4
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
